 "title": "House Groove",
 "category": "Drums and grooves",
 "text": "Sound: the classic four-on-the-floor of house and dance music: a kick on every beat, a clap on 2 and 4, open-ish hats on the off-beats. It plays by itself.\n\nHow it's built: one Clock. The kick (a sine with a fast pitch drop) on every BEAT. The clap: band-passed noise with a slightly soft attack, from a Sequencer on eighths with steps 3 and 7 on. The hats: high-passed noise from a second Sequencer, even steps only (the off-beats), with a longer decay. Mixed, a touch of Reverb.\n\nTweak: TEMPO; the hats' DECAY; the sequencers' steps; the drum levels.",
